# Juxta6 agent scope

Canonical detail: `agents/RULES.md`.

- User owns build, flash, RTT, and hardware debug via **nRF Connect**. Do not run `west build`, `west flash`, or debugger/RTT sessions.
- Document board (`nrf54l15tag/nrf54l15/cpuapp`), `rtt-console`, and app paths; wait for user feedback.
- Never west-build or edit `reference/juxta5-8/`.
- Prefer Zephyr DT aliases / sensors API; ADXL367 motion only; BMI/BME off unless probing; BTN1=magnet; LED1 only.
- Channel Sounding / RAS only in `lib/juxta_range/`. Never copy DK CS antenna overlays onto Tag TWI pins.
- Keep HIL apps small; no Hublink / NOR logger / MCUboot / Encounter Manager / Juxta prod unless explicitly requested.
- iOS companion is `companion/iOS` (Xcode **Juxta6**); do not west-build it.
- Power, DEBUG OUT, missing board target, or missing CS Kconfig: stop and ask.
